# DevOps Rules

## General Principles

- Prefer reproducible environments
- Keep infrastructure portable
- Avoid machine-specific configurations
- Use environment variables for configuration

---

# Docker

- Dockerize backend services
- Use lightweight images when possible
- Use multi-stage builds for production
- Avoid running containers as root

Example:

```dockerfile
FROM node:20-alpine

WORKDIR /app

COPY package*.json ./

RUN npm install

COPY . .

RUN npm run build

CMD ["npm", "start"]
```
